{"version":1,"key":"card:598","content":{"id":598,"content":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"在早期，由于用户量和流量较少，一台计算机也可以满足服务，然而时至今日，互联网用户的数量已不可同日而语，无论是出于高可用还是高性能的目的，企业都需要通过横向扩展机器来扩展服务能力，期望用户不论访问哪一台机器，都可以得到同样的服务，并且这件事情对于用户是透明的，不论背后是多少台机器在提供服务，用户只需要知道一个域名，就可以享受到服务。因此需要一种技术组件以统一的接口来调度后方的多台机器，这个技术组件就是负载均衡。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"负载均衡："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"DNS 负载均衡"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"通过 DNS 服务器配置多个 IP 地址，根据请求动态返回不同的 IP"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"四层负载均衡"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"四层负载均衡是多种负载均衡器的统称，主要工作在第二层（数据链路层，修改 MAC 地址）和第三层（网络层，修改 IP 地址），这里的四层是指这些模式的共同特点是复用同一个 TCP 连接"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"数据链路层负载均衡"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"数据链路层负载均衡器修改数据帧中的目的 MAC 地址，让原本发送给负载均衡器的数据帧，被二层交换机根据新的 MAC 地址转发到对应的真实服务器上。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"服务器为了能够处理转发的数据帧，必须保证和负载均衡器具有相同的 IP，正因此，响应报文无需经由均衡器转换，可以直接由服务器发送给客户端，避免负载均衡器成为瓶颈，性能是非常高的。"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_19f399b1-c63d-472d-8da1-7d686596242e.webp","uuid":"05c4b34f-a3e9-41aa-bdc6-c6d504ca49b0","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_19f399b1-c63d-472d-8da1-7d686596242e.webp","width":648.312456313768},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"缺点是在网络侧受到了约束，要求真实服务器和负载均衡器必须是二层可达的，即在一个子网中，无法跨 VLAN，因此这种负载均衡器常用于数据中心的第一级均衡设备。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"网络层负载均衡"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"有两种常见的修改方式："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"IP 隧道"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"保持原数据包不变，新创建一个数据包，将原数据包作为新数据包的负载，新数据包的目的地址修改为真实服务器的地址，然后发出去，经过三层交换机的转发，真实服务器受到后需要进行一个拆包的机制，把负载均衡器添加的那层 Header 去掉，还原出真实的数据包。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"由于需要进行封装新的数据包，效率比直接进行路由转发效率较低，但是由于没有修改数据包，响应仍然可以通过服务器直接发送给客户端。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_0dbf784e-92a0-4c6a-aeae-5247f75adcc8.webp","uuid":"fb483e18-7f36-41a9-9196-595f133f41c9","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_0dbf784e-92a0-4c6a-aeae-5247f75adcc8.webp","width":687.712660841124},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"而且 IP 隧道工作在网络层，可以跨越 VLAN。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"此种方式要求服务器必须支持 "},{"type":"styled-text","color":"blue","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"IP 隧道协议"}]},{"type":"formatted","text":"，自己得会把外层的那层包给拆掉，另外同样，服务器必须配置为与均衡器具有相同的 IP，不太"},{"type":"formatted","text":"透明","bold":true},{"type":"formatted","text":"，需要系统管理员介入。"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"NAT"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"直接修改数据包的头部，把头部中的目标 IP 地址修改为服务器的地址，然后发送出去，被三层交换器转发到真实服务器上。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"带来的问题是修改了数据包，真实服务器无法直接把响应发送给客户端，因为对客户端来说它发送出去的目的 IP 地址不是真实服务器的 IP 地址，客户端可能不认识该 IP，因此得让响应回到负载均衡器，然后把源 IP 地址修改为负载均衡器的 IP 地址。"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_1d987bf8-f656-4402-a361-09e4dc802e0b.webp","uuid":"7dd1f78f-e09e-4da0-9c64-145595cecd16","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_1d987bf8-f656-4402-a361-09e4dc802e0b.webp","width":687.712660841124},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"此种方式不要求均衡器和服务器具有相同的 IP，带来的代价是均衡器可能成为带宽的瓶颈，当流量比较大的时候，相比于直接路由和 IP 隧道，会呈现数量级的下降。在学校，公司，家里面就是这样的模式，所以若是有人在下载，你的网络会卡顿是一个道理。"}]},{"type":"callout","calloutType":"warning","title":"思考","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"当真实服务器发送响应的时候，为什么一定会经过均衡器返回呢？是不是有做什么操作？应该在转发请求的时候，把源 IP 地址给改了，改为均衡器的地址，这样通过网络才能保证回到均衡器，然后均衡器在把源 IP 地址目的 IP 地址修改正确。"}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这个就是更彻底的 NAT 模式，称为源 NAT（SNAT），缺点是服务器无法获取客户端的 IP 地址了，因为服务器认为所有的流量都来自于均衡器，如果有一些需要根据目标 IP 进行控制的业务就无法进行。"}]}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"七层负载均衡"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"七层负载均衡相比于四层需要多进行一次握手，并且有着和 NAT 模式一样的带宽问题"}]},{"type":"image","url":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_a3ddea75-27f7-4cbe-a3ee-68a3e741a979.webp","uuid":"0d581a74-be3c-4cdb-bb0b-db591383a534","pasteUploading":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}],"previewUrl":"http://blog-hostimaging.oss-cn-beijing.aliyuncs.com/image_a3ddea75-27f7-4cbe-a3ee-68a3e741a979.webp","width":687.712660841124},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"但是七层负载均衡器知道很多应用层的信息，可以做很灵活的处理："}],"disableDrag":false},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"智能化路由"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"抵御安全攻击"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"链路治理"}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"服务熔断"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"服务降级"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"异常注入"}]}]}]}]}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"参考："}]},{"type":"bulleted-list","children":[{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"《凤凰架构》，4.5 负载均衡"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"《HTTP 权威指南》，第 20 章，重定向与负载均衡"}]}]}]}],"tags":["负载均衡"],"createTime":1752915674468,"updateTime":1777611101081,"linkedCards":[]},"meta":{"type":"card","publishTime":1777611101081}}